{"content":[{"c":["AZRIKAM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["1. One of three sons of Neariah, a descendant of David through Zerubbabel (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.3.23","r":"1Chr.3.23","rawR":"1Chr.3.23","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.3.23","value":"1Chr.3.23"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 3:23"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["2. One of six sons of Azel, a descendant of Saul (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.8.38","r":"1Chr.8.38","rawR":"1Chr.8.38","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.8.38","value":"1Chr.8.38"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 8:38"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.44","r":"1Chr.9.44","rawR":"1Chr.9.44","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.44","value":"1Chr.9.44"}],"t":"ref","v":"9:44"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["3. Ancestor of Shemaiah, a Levite who returned to Jerusalem after the exile (",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.9.14","r":"1Chr.9.14","rawR":"1Chr.9.14","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.9.14","value":"1Chr.9.14"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chr 9:14"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Neh.11.15","r":"Neh.11.15","rawR":"Neh.11.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.11.15","value":"Neh.11.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 11:15"},")."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"},{"c":["4. Palace officer under King Ahaz of Judah who was killed by Zichri (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.28.7","r":"2Chr.28.7","rawR":"2Chr.28.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.28.7","value":"2Chr.28.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 28:7"},"), possibly the same as #2 above."],"sourceClass":"list","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Azrikam","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Chr 3:23","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.3.23","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.3.23","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.3.23"},{"anchorText":"1 Chr 8:38","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Chr.8.38","rawQueryValue":"1Chr.8.38","sourceRefExact":"1Chr.8.38"},{"anchorText":"9:44","canonicalization":"defer